- @labor_affairs

@labor_affairs
title: Labor Affairs
view-if: labor_minister_party == "DVP" and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0

The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest

- @balance
- @support_employers

@balance
title: The DVP will try to strike a compromise between the sides.
view-if: dvp_ideology == "Left" and (dvp_leader == "Stresemann" or dvp_leader == "Thiel" or dvp_leader == "zu Dohna-Schlodien" or dvp_leader == "Glatzel")

Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.

go-to: labor_affairs.balance

@support_employers
title: The DVP will support the employers in their demands.
view-if: dvp_ideology != "Left" or (dvp_leader != "Stresemann" and dvp_leader != "Thiel" and dvp_leader != "zu Dohna-Schlodien" and dvp_leader != "Glatzel")

Popular among the bourgeoisie, much less so among the workers.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_employers